# Capacitor native projects (apps/web/android, apps/web/ios). Build outputs,
# copied web assets and generated config are ignored by the per-platform
# .gitignore files Capacitor generates; these are the secrets/local files.
# Firebase config is per-environment and stays local - never commit it.
